 | `--today YYYY-MM-DD` | list, renewals, export | Pretend today is another date. |
 | `--file <path>` | all | Where your subscriptions are kept. Default: `$SUBTRACK_FILE`, else `./subscriptions.json`. |
 
 ## Money
 
-Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. The monthly cost of a yearly plan is its
-price divided by 12.
+Prices are typed in euros (`12.99`, `1,299.00`) and kept in whole cents. Monthly costs are calculated from the billing cycle and rounded to the nearest cent:
+- Monthly: price is the monthly cost
+- Yearly: price ÷ 12 is the monthly cost
+- Weekly: price × 52 ÷ 12 is the monthly cost (€12 per week ≈ €52 per month)
 
